  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Icod.Terminal 1.3.0 adds a typed, bounded iTerm2 OSC 1337 shell-integration and semantic-history metadata surface while preserving the stable 1.x contract and the existing portable OSC 7/133 APIs. The new TerminalSession operations cover SetMark, CurrentDir, RemoteHost, Base64-backed SetUserVar, the current ShellIntegrationVersion=...;shell=... form, and ClearCapturedOutput. OSC 1337 values use strict UTF-8, complete-frame prevalidation, a 65536-byte payload ceiling, shared session output serialization, and pre-commit cancellation. Generic raw OSC 1337 dispatch and invasive profile/focus/browser/pasteboard/file-transfer/custom-script mutation surfaces remain excluded. The release retains net8.0/net9.0/net10.0, existing dependencies, and all prior 1.x semantics. Full notes: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.3.0/docs/releases/1.3.0.md ; compatibility: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.3.0/docs/Compatibility-and-Versioning.md",
